<title>USA: US spot MTBE continues to fall, weak demand.</title>
<headline>US spot MTBE continues to fall, weak demand.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spot MTBE prices continued to fall in extremely light trade this week, still heavy under ample supply and weak demand, players said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The weakeness is despite a rally in NYMEX gasoline futures, which ended up 1.59 cents at $69.82 a barrel.</p>
<p>&quot;It's a strange market that it is not even slightly following gasoline,&quot; said one Houston trader.</p>
</text>
